1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,800
What if your shop could help you do the work?

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,700
Veyndo connects AI, commerce and extensible apps in one platform.

3
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:15,500
Describe the result you want. The agent uses your catalogue and current context.

4
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:21,700
It prepares connected work that you can inspect, edit and approve.

5
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:28,500
The storefront, apps and agents use the same native Rust commerce operations.

6
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:35,700
Prices, stock, permissions and orders stay connected to one authoritative core.

7
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:42,100
Storyfront creates the shopping experience. Veyndo supplies the catalogue, cart and checkout.

8
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:46,100
The native checkout stays embedded in the experience.

9
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:49,700
After a successful demo purchase, returning shows an empty basket.

10
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:55,500
Explore changes in a private sandbox before they reach your live shop.

11
00:00:55,800 --> 00:01:01,700
Review the selected changes, then publish through the existing release controls.

12
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:06,500
One platform for merchant work, shopping experiences and new capabilities.

13
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:11,700
Explore Veyndo, try the demos and build on the shared foundation.
